# Justice Ranger

**Alignments.** Any, but typically good, unprincipled or aberrant. Most are
honourable, courageous and resourceful and live by the Code of the New West -
but a fifth are so extreme and vicious that they are not much better than the
criminals they hunt, and one in twenty is downright evil.

The Justice Rangers are a brotherhood of lawmen, and an institution more than
seventy years old. Every true Ranger was taught the ways by another Ranger, and
that passing-on is what has kept them alive as a body. Plenty of other men at
arms ride with them and are counted in their ranks, but those are deputies,
junior Rangers, allies and sympathisers rather than Rangers proper.

## Numbers

An estimated one to two thousand exist. They are most numerous in the north but
are found throughout the west and as far south as New Mexico and Lone Star. The
average is 2nd to 6th level, male, and between twenty and fifty years old. Half
are human, a quarter Psi-Stalkers, one in twenty cyborgs, one in fifty mutant
animals, and the rest various mostly human-looking races.

## Lore

Also known as the North Rangers, the Demon Slayers and the Wrath of God.
